msgid ""
"Add :exc:`~pathlib.UnsupportedOperation`, which is raised instead "
"of :exc:`NotImplementedError` when a path operation isn't supported. "
"(Contributed by Barney Gale in :gh:`89812`.)"
msgstr ""

#: whatsnew/3.13.rst:1111
msgid ""
"Add a new constructor for creating :class:`~pathlib.Path` objects from "
