#: whatsnew/3.13.rst:2192
msgid ""
"Add :c:func:`PyModule_Add` function, which is similar "
"to :c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef` and :c:func:`PyModule_AddObject`, but "
"always steals a reference to the value. (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka "
"in :gh:`86493`.)"
